OL,3,GNEWSAChild, 6, dies weeks after
OL,4,AWaterford arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy who was critically
OL,7,Finjured in a suspected arson attack at
OL,8,Fhis family home in County Waterford has
OL,9,Fdied.
OL,11,FElliot English died on Friday at
OL,12,FChildren's Health Ireland (CHI)
OL,13,Fhospital in Crumlin in Dublin.
OL,15,FHis parents, Kim English and Philip
OL,16,FEnglish, and two of his siblings,
OL,17,F12-year-old Callum and nine-year-old
OL,18,FJayden, died in the house fire on Birch
OL,19,FAvenue, on the outskirts of Waterford
OL,20,Fon 13 October.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
